{
  "id": "ch03_s24_shuge",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "给三种身份各递来下一件事，留给第四章实际作答",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "翌日，唐将小账与原卷分放。你买的纸已有收据，新递来的东西压在砚边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l2",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "新送来的没写已办，可以先看，或留时辰答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "哪一份找我？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "有人问，新署仍由近人经手，是不是只换名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "近人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是礼成以后递的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。具名，还有两份同议。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两份。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不在旧卷里，要今日在位的人答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你揭开封面，第一行顶着新称谓。纸的背面还空着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "同议放来，先读，不替我批。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（昨天才把我的名字念完。今天已经有人在下面写，不妥。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "辞受、重推另存，这张问往后寄到哪儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "寄到哪儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一定得今日填？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不用，住处未改就照旧投递。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "照旧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没有新职，不算漏了一项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将纸摊到亮处。空行够写很长一串字，笔尖没有落下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先留着，今日晚些出门。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下次公议问扩办款，你的案仍列着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "扩办款。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "去听与领差，分开答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的反对也能当面念？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "能，主持已签受理，时辰在末行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l27",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "末行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l28",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "带几页自己挑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l29",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将邀请牒折到时辰那一行，放在自己的提案上。纸角没有再硌着掌心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先看，不替我答新差。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l32",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐将砚盖揭开，墨面上浮着一丝窗光。门外有人走过，没有进来催。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l33",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这回先不写……已办成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l34",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l35",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原件放这，我看完就——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l36",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "看完再落笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l38",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l39",
      "who": "empty",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "案脚一片薄木垫在砖缝上，暮光停在翘起的那一端。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s24_shuge.l40",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你将唐递来的第一件纸放到案前，伸手取笔。"
    }
  ],
  "chapterEnd": true,
  "goto": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang"
}
